/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (Open with the relationship between money and space. A housing proposal needs land, design, approvals, infrastructure and finance. This presentation asks where NHB fits into that process and whether its support produces homes that people can afford and use. Estimated speaking time: 15\20518 minutes. The interactive activities are optional during a short classroom slot.) /QuadPoints [ 1245 686 1260 686 1245 701 1260 701 ] /Rect [ 1245 686 1260 701 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
