/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (Explain the difference between a housing need and bankable demand. A family may need a house but lack documented income, clear title or the savings for an initial contribution. NHB\220s creation addressed institutional finance constraints. The final statement is architectural analysis: increasing credit alone cannot supply serviced land or guarantee an adequate dwelling. The institution emerged from the Seventh Five Year Plan review, followed by the Rangarajan-led high-level group and the 1987 legislative decision.) /QuadPoints [ 1245 686 1260 686 1245 701 1260 701 ] /Rect [ 1245 686 1260 701 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
