/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (Use the 2019 milestone to correct a common textbook error. Government ownership and the transfer of regulatory powers are separate changes in the same year. Regulation concerns the rules and registration of HFCs. NHB continues inspections and monitoring, as the latest annual report confirms. Do not describe NHB as the current licensing authority for HFCs. RESIDEX tracks residential prices rather than construction cost or the affordability of every household.) /QuadPoints [ 1245 686 1260 686 1245 701 1260 701 ] /Rect [ 1245 686 1260 701 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
