/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (The table separates two financing relationships. Avoid presenting one universal NHB rate, collateral rule or tenure. Institutional security may include the relevant statutory security arrangements and scheme documentation. The underlying retail mortgage belongs to the PLI. Refinance can support liquidity, but a PLI still assesses repayment ability and clear title. In the 2024 scheme booklet, loans for furnishing, fees and insurance are also excluded. Resource mobilisation is covered in the latest annual report, printed pp.35\20536.) /QuadPoints [ 1245 686 1260 686 1245 701 1260 701 ] /Rect [ 1245 686 1260 701 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
