/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (This is the core housing slide. Explain that NHB\220s influence is usually indirect. It does not choose every plot or design every dwelling. Technology and materials enter through research, capacity building and green-housing support. NHB is not a construction-technology certification agency. Rural housing access also depends on income seasonality, title and the local lender network. UIDF urban services complement housing but its sanctioned projects cannot all be counted as houses.) /QuadPoints [ 1245 686 1260 686 1245 701 1260 701 ] /Rect [ 1245 686 1260 701 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
