/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (Read one row across as objective, target group, mechanism, implementation and outcome. AHF uses institutional refinance, whereas ISS uses a subsidy credited through a PLI. UIDF supports infrastructure. SUNREF combined credit, investment support and technical assistance. The latest report, printed pp.40\20544 and Annexure VIII, supplies the current data. Additional NHB initiatives include fixed-rate refinance, construction refinance, small-ticket rural loans and a slum redevelopment / low-cost housing scheme. RHISS has historically supported eligible rural households outside the relevant PMAY coverage. CRGFTLIH provides credit-risk support to eligible lenders for lower-income housing. Neither a guarantee nor a subsidy means automatic loan approval.) /QuadPoints [ 1245 686 1260 686 1245 701 1260 701 ] /Rect [ 1245 686 1260 701 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
