/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (Keep a critical tone. The case source describes green measures and buyer interviews, but those do not prove reduced bills for every resident. The source describes AAC blocks in one section and CLC blocks in the detailed envelope specification. Do not select one as verified without project drawings. The lesson for an architect is to coordinate an affordable unit with common services, accessible circulation and a maintenance plan. The discussion answer is an interpretation rather than a measured project outcome.) /QuadPoints [ 1245 686 1260 686 1245 701 1260 701 ] /Rect [ 1245 686 1260 701 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
