/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (Point to the difference between a flow and a stock. Disbursement is money released during a year. Outstanding is the balance still owed at a date. Cumulative refinance is a historical sum and is not the number of distinct homes constructed. The latest annual report gives exact AHF units in Annexure VIII. HFCs received about 80.4% of the year\220s refinance. The financing network is an achievement, but social and architectural outcomes require additional evidence.) /QuadPoints [ 1245 686 1260 686 1245 701 1260 701 ] /Rect [ 1245 686 1260 701 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
