/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (Separate the strength of an institution from the limits of its instrument. A larger refinance portfolio can coexist with exclusion. For sustainability, consider energy and water systems alongside access to jobs and everyday services. Administrative challenges include coordination, reliable documentation and monitoring. Financial challenges include repayment risk and interest-rate movements. The independent SUNREF evaluation gives a concrete example of weak borrower pass-through and monitoring, discussed on slide 16.) /QuadPoints [ 1245 686 1260 686 1245 701 1260 701 ] /Rect [ 1245 686 1260 701 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
