/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (These are professional implications, not a list of compulsory NHB submission documents for every scheme. DPR means detailed project report. Scheme compliance depends on the selected programme, approvals and applicable local requirements. Explain lifecycle affordability using construction cost, EMI, utility bills, maintenance and transport. A specification for efficient equipment should include how residents or the association can maintain and replace it. Technology should fit local capability and budget.) /QuadPoints [ 1245 686 1260 686 1245 701 1260 701 ] /Rect [ 1245 686 1260 701 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
