81 0 obj
<<
/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (This is the strongest evidence-based critical slide. AFD\220s project evaluation distinguishes activities from attributable effects. The programme achieved revised participation targets, but that does not show the programme caused those patterns. Its environmental claim was difficult to attribute because properties already existed. The 2.4% measure relates to the evaluation\220s applicable interest-rate cap, not to all forms of support. The concluding assessment follows the evaluator\220s recommendations for market-sensitive financial design, coordination and measured outcomes. Avoid applying the programme percentages to the Palghar project.) /QuadPoints [ 1245 686 1260 686 1245 701 1260 701 ] /Rect [ 1245 686 1260 701 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
