/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (Close with a judgement, not a repeat of the definition. NHB is necessary to housing-finance infrastructure, but finance should be evaluated against its effects on residents. The practical professional response is to connect financing eligibility and cost control to quality, location and post-occupancy evidence. Use the check question only if time permits. A likely viva question is whether NHB can solve the housing shortage by itself. Answer that it works through a wider system of lenders, governments, public agencies and developers.) /QuadPoints [ 1245 686 1260 686 1245 701 1260 701 ] /Rect [ 1245 686 1260 701 ] /Subtype /Text /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
